th several large retailers. We refer to our network of independent distributors as our direct store delivery (\u201cDSD\u201d) channel, and we refer to our national and regional accounts who receive shipments directly from us as our direct to retail (\u201cDTR\u201d) channel.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083522/000149315225023397/form10-q.htm","filed":"2025-11-14","source":"10-Q"},"da_v":2}